# Captured portal HTML preserved verbatim: the real ComWeb server sends CRLF and
# byte-fidelity to that output matters for the fixtures.  `-text` disables EOL
# conversion; `-whitespace` stops git from flagging the CR as trailing whitespace
# (git diff --check / git apply).  Intentional CRLF, not a hygiene miss (P2).
comweb_*.html -text -whitespace
